{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:07780be292840b17","name":"Sith Apprentice Talent Trees","source":{"id":"source:reference-07780be292840b17","title":"Sith Apprentice Talent Trees","revision":18496,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:12:47Z","sha256":"098945a679420c6ec9087a7c6e7370ce660080337a6956799dcd785b1c9d934a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18496","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Sith%20Apprentice%20Talent%20Trees&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-07780be292840b17","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["At every odd-numbered level (1st, 3rd, 5th, and so on), a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Apprentice"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Apprentice","referenceId":"reference:580167d0bdd39739"}," gains an additional Sith Apprentice Talent. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Apprentice"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Apprentice","referenceId":"reference:580167d0bdd39739"}," may choose a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," from any of the following Sith Apprentice Talent Trees or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Talent Trees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Talent_Trees"}," they wish, but they must meet the prerequisites (if any) of the chosen Sith Apprentice Talent. No ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," can be selected more than once unless expressly indicated.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talent Trees"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TALENT TREE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DESCRIPTION\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Armor Specialist Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor_Specialist_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:e4e9b2aabaed45b7"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You can maximize the benefits of wearing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," while reducing or eliminating some of its drawbacks.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Duelist Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Duelist_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:5c1f05597abfb6ef"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Through rigorous training and experience, you become one of the greatest swordfighters in the galaxy.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Combat Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Combat_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:11614943ef3f899e"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," is the chosen weapon of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"},". Not as clumsy or random as a blaster, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," is an elegant weapon for a more civilized combatant. The following talents allow you to improve your prowess with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},".\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:02c8fb037b4cc8a5"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"}," believe in order through tyranny. In ancient days, Sith Warriors battled Jedi Knights for galactic supremacy until, finally, the few remaining Sith were driven into hiding. Since then, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"}," have conspired to annihilate ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," and everything they stand for.\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Additional Talent Trees"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TALENT TREE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DESCRIPTION\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Commander Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Commander_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:8c99504c1da3d8b8"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"}," use terror to lead their troops, and Sith Commanders have few compunctions about making examples of underlings. Therefore, it is not surprising that ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"}," use anger and fear of their subordinates to their own terrible advantage.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Alchemy Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Alchemy_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:e965af2a898e4eec"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You have learned the alchemical arts of the ancient ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Lords"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Lords"}," and can create objects and creatures that are filled with the power of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
